# The loop has more than 100 operations. Its stores put results of operators on numbers into elements, so it is versioned: the object, the field and the array are checked before it.
# RUN: walk f2:Body mechanisms=all
# CHECK: testedType=Int8Array
# CHECK: PutTypedArrayElement
# CHECK-NEXT: BitOr
